# Handoff

There is no `MEMORY.md`. The handoff is three files in the repo root:

- `AGENT_LOG.md` — what was done, decisions, measurements, what is still open
- `ROADMAP.md` — what is next
- `AUDIT.md` — architecture and open problems

At the start of a chat, before answering about this game or editing it, read all three.

After a task that changes the game, the tests, or those decisions, append a dated entry to `AGENT_LOG.md`. Leave older entries in place. Do not start a second memory file.

A new chat on any model picks up by reading these files. The files are the memory. The chat is not.
